vertical padding, 36px horizontal padding, 2px solid Burgundy Crest border, no border-radius (square corners). 'View Fixtures' is a secondary outlined button: transparent background, 2px solid Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) border, Crown Ivory text, same typographic and sizing treatment. Both buttons have a hover state: primary darkens to a deeper burgundy with a Championship Gold border; outlined fills to Crown Ivory with Courtside Navy text.\n\nAt the very bottom of the hero viewport, add a subtle scroll-indicator: a small downward chevron in Championship Gold, centered, with gentle vertical breathing animation, 40px above the section bottom edge.\n\nOn mobile, the emblem scales to 100px, headline to 36px, subheadline to 16px, and the two CTA buttons stack vertically at full width with 12px gap."
