e rule (16px margin), the description text in Source Serif 4, 16px, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A), line-height 1.7, centered.\n\nBelow the card grid (40px margin), place a single centered CTA button 'Explore Programmes' \u2014 Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F) filled, Crown Ivory text, Montserrat uppercase 13px wide-spaced, 14px vertical padding, 40px horizontal padding, square corners, 2px solid Burgundy Crest border.\n\nOn tablet, cards reflow to 2-column + 1 centered below. On mobile, single-column stack, each card full-width."
