          "nl_prompt": "Design a testimonial card row section that builds emotional trust through three member voices. The background alternates to Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) to create a warm, intimate tonal shift. Section vertical padding is 96px top and bottom on desktop, 64px on tablet, 48px on mobile.\n\nAt the top center, place the eyebrow label 'Member Stories' in Montserrat uppercase, 11px, wide letter-spacing (0.18em), Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F). Below it, the headline 'Heard on the Terrace' in Playfair Display, 44px on desktop (32px on mobile), Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), sentence case, centered, with italic styling applied to 'Terrace' to add a literary, storied quality. Separate the header from the card row with a centered ornamental divider: 80px Championship Gold rule with flanking diamond lozenges, 28px vertical margin.\n\nThe three testimonial cards are displayed in a 3-column grid on desktop with 28px gutters, max-width 1100px, centered. Each card: Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) background, 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) border, 4px corner radius, 40px internal padding, box shadow (0 2px 12px rgba(27,42,74,0.07)).\n\nWithin each card: at the top left, a large decorative opening quotation mark in Playfair Display at 72px, Championship Gold (#B8962E), line-height 0.8, acting as a visual anchor \u2014 it sits above the quote text with no gap, creating an overlapping typographic ornament. The testimonial quote text ('Courtside & Crown gave my daughter more than a backhand...', 'Training here feels different...', 'I started at forty with no experience...') is set in Source Serif 4 italic, 17px, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), line-height 1.75, with the opening quotation mark integrated. Below the quote (20px margin), a thin 40px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) rule. Below the rule (16px margin), the attribution ('Margaret T., Club Member since 1998', 'James R., Junior Squad Captain', 'Dr. Priya N., Adult Beginner Programme') in Montserrat uppercase, 11px, wide letter-spacing (0.15em), Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A).\n\nOn tablet, cards reflow to a 2-column + 1 centered layout. On mobile, single-column stack. No CTAs in this section."
        },
        {
          "id": "home-section-5",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a full-width conversion CTA section that closes the home page with a compelling, textured invitation to join or get in touch. The section uses Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A) as the primary background surface, bookending the page with the same dark authority as the hero.\n\nThe background texture is provided by the repeating diagonal tennis court line pattern asset \u2014 a subtle, low-opacity (8\u201310% opacity) pattern overlay of diagonal court lines and diamond grid motifs in Crown Ivory, layered over the Navy background. This texture must sit behind all content as a purely decorative layer, never competing with text legibility. The pattern tiles seamlessly across the full section width.\n\nSection vertical padding is 104px top and bottom on desktop, 72px on tablet, 56px on mobile. All content is centered on a single vertical axis.\n\nAt the top center, place the eyebrow label 'Your First Step Starts Here' in Montserrat uppercase, 11px, wide letter-spacing (0.18em), Championship Gold (#B8962E). Below it, the headline 'Ready to Step onto the Court?' in Playfair Display, 52px on desktop (36px on mobile), Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8), sentence case, centered, max-width 700px. Below the headline (20px margin), the subheadline 'Whether you are a complete beginner or a seasoned competitor, there is a place for you at Courtside & Crown.' in Source Serif 4, 19px, Slate Mist (#D6D9E0), line-height 1.7, centered, max-width 600px.\n\nSeparate the text block from the CTAs with a centered ornamental divider: a 60px Championship Gold horizontal rule with flanking diamond lozenges, 28px vertical margin above and below.\n\nBelow the divider, place two CTA buttons side by side with 16px gap, centered. 'Get in Touch' is the primary filled button: Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F) background, Crown Ivory text, Montserrat uppercase 13px wide-spaced, 14px vertical padding, 40px horizontal padding, square corners, 2px solid Burgundy Crest border. Hover state: border shifts to Championship Gold, background deepens slightly. 'Read the Latest News' is the secondary outlined button: transparent background, 2px solid Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) border, Crown Ivory text, same typographic and sizing treatment. Hover state: background fills to Crown Ivory, text shifts to Courtside Navy.\n\nOn mobile, both buttons stack vertically at full width with 12px gap. The pattern texture remains at full width on all breakpoints but reduces to 6% opacity on mobile to maintain legibility on smaller screens."
        }
