          "nl_prompt": "**Section Type:** Timeline\n**Background:** Full-bleed Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) to create visual separation from the navy page header above. Section padding: 96px top and bottom on desktop, 56px on mobile.\n\n**Section Header (Centered):**\nEyebrow: 'Our History' \u2014 Montserrat, uppercase, small caps, Championship Gold (#B8962E), 11px, wide letter-spacing (0.18em), centered.\nOrnamental Gold Rule: 1px horizontal line, 56px wide, Championship Gold, centered, between eyebrow and headline.\nHeadline: 'One Hundred Years, One Unbroken Tradition' \u2014 Playfair Display, ~44px desktop / 30px mobile, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), centered, sentence case, max-width 640px.\n\n**Timeline Layout \u2014 Desktop (\u22651024px):**\nA vertical center-spine layout. A continuous 2px vertical line runs down the center of the section in Championship Gold (#B8962E). Timeline entries alternate left and right of the spine \u2014 odd entries (1923, 1974, 2003) anchor to the left column; even entries (1951, 1989, 2023) anchor to the right column. Each entry connects to the spine via a short 24px horizontal rule in Championship Gold. At each connection point, a small circular medallion (14px diameter) filled with Courtside Navy and ringed in Championship Gold marks the node.\n\n**Timeline Entry Cards:**\nEach entry is presented as a compact card: Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) background, 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) border, 4px border-radius, 24px internal padding. Maximum card width 340px.\n- Year/Title: Playfair Display, H4 scale (~20px), Courtside Navy, bold weight. The year portion is set in Championship Gold to visually anchor the date.\n- Description: Source Serif 4, 15px, line-height 1.7, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A).\nCards have a subtle drop shadow (0 2px 8px rgba(27,42,74,0.08)) for gentle lift off the linen background.\n\n**Timeline Layout \u2014 Mobile (\u2264640px):**\nThe alternating layout collapses to a single left-aligned list. The vertical spine moves to the far left (16px from the container edge). All cards are full-width, left-aligned, connected to the spine by a short horizontal rule. Node medallions remain. Vertical spacing between entries: 32px.\n\n**Spacing Between Entries (Desktop):** 48px vertical gap between consecutive entry pairs.\n\n**Bottom of Section:** A thin ornamental Championship Gold rule (full container width, 1px) with a small centered crest flourish marks the section close before transitioning to the coaching grid."
